title: "schema-check: certificates for canonical JSON completion"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: Takimoto
    given-names: Tatsuhiko
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - CC-BY-4.0
abstract: "Inspect JSON Schema constraints using a supported canonical UTF-8 reference language. The tools compute emptiness and shortest byte completions with separate checking entries, provide fixed-vocabulary token certificates, and retain finite probes of pinned external backends. They do not cover all JSON Schema or arbitrary sampling termination. No DOI is specified."
keywords:
  - JSON Schema
  - canonical UTF-8
  - finite automata
  - certificate verification
  - constrained decoding
date-released: 2026-11-20
repository-code: https://github.com/tkmt-lab/schema-check
